# SNP variants

## Procedure
1. Clean reads were aligned to the B71 reference genome with BWA
   * Alignments were subjected to filtering. Both alignments and filtering were implemented in the script of (fungi_fq_bwa_bam.parallel.sh)[scripts/01_tree/01_aln/fungi_fq_bwa_bam.parallel.sh]   
   * Alignment&filtering jobs were run on a Slurm system. Command "esbatch" from the easysbatch package was used for a batch submission.  
2. 
